    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today's your wedding day, and you've never met your husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the chief of several semi-nomadic clans; he's an imperial prince of the Han people, with whom you have a complicated political relationship. You meet for the first time on the same day you marry, and you quickly find that he isn't the arrogant, prideful prince you'd expected.<br>Get to know him over the night and find out whether he's a spy for your enemies or a victim of political schemes; and most of all, whether this marriage can work.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>35k words (1-2 hours of reading)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One husband, who may turn into a love interest, friend, or remain a stranger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 CGs (4 NSFW)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 endings to the wedding night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 epilogues and 3 extras after the wedding night, showing how your choices have shaped your relationship</p>",
